{
 "total": 34.78,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This Christmas tree swims, stings, and falls apart if you touch it.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.584
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a Christmas tree siphonophore.",
   "visual": "name",
   "start": 3.584,
   "end": 5.48
  },
  {
   "text": "It can be up to three meters long.",
   "visual": "size",
   "start": 5.48,
   "end": 7.298
  },
  {
   "text": "At the top is a tiny gas float.",
   "visual": "float",
   "start": 7.298,
   "end": 9.317
  },
  {
   "text": "Below it, many swimming bells pump water.",
   "visual": "bells",
   "start": 9.317,
   "end": 11.692
  },
  {
   "text": "So it drifts and twirls through the dark.",
   "visual": "twirl",
   "start": 11.692,
   "end": 13.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Its branches look like decorations.",
   "visual": "decor",
   "start": 13.88,
   "end": 15.968
  },
  {
   "text": "But they're loaded with stinging cells.",
   "visual": "sting",
   "start": 15.968,
   "end": 18.055
  },
  {
   "text": "Small shrimp and fish that touch them get stunned.",
   "visual": "prey",
   "start": 18.055,
   "end": 20.908
  },
  {
   "text": "Then its feeding parts swallow them.",
   "visual": "eat",
   "start": 20.908,
   "end": 22.766
  },
  {
   "text": "But it's so delicate, it breaks apart at the slightest touch.",
   "visual": "fragile",
   "start": 22.766,
   "end": 26.077
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why scientists study it with robot submarines.",
   "visual": "rov",
   "start": 26.077,
   "end": 29.438
  },
  {
   "text": "A beautiful tree you should never touch.",
   "visual": "final",
   "start": 29.438,
   "end": 31.766
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow BioNiche for more weird animals.",
   "visual": "cta",
   "start": 31.766,
   "end": 34.78
  }
 ],
